<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HoàngMân - Tính giá in tem</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/html2canvas/1.4.1/html2canvas.min.js"></script>

    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: { extend: { fontFamily: { sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'] }, colors: { primary: '#0ea5e9', secondary: '#10b981', dark: '#0f172a' } } }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        .mat-giay { background-color: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); }
        .mat-nhua-sua { background-color: #f8fafc; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), inset 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,0.8); }
        .mat-pp { background-color: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); filter: contrast(1.05); }
        .mat-trong { background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, #e2e8f0 25%, transparent 25%), linear-gradient(-45deg, #e2e8f0 25%, transparent 25%), linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 75%, #e2e8f0 75%), linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent 75%, #e2e8f0 75%); background-size: 20px 20px; background-position: 0 0, 0 10px, 10px -10px, -10px 0px; background-color: #f1f5f9; }
        .mat-xi { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e2e2e2 0%, #9ca3af 50%, #e2e2e2 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }
        .mat-kraft { background-color: #C19A6B; background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noiseFilter'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.8' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noiseFilter)' opacity='0.15'/%3E%3C/svg%3E"); }

        .shape-rectangle { border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; }
        .shape-circle { border-radius: 50%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; overflow: hidden; }
        .shape-eclipse { border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; }
        .shape-triangle { clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 0% 100%, 100% 100%); }
        .shape-pentagon { clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 38%, 82% 100%, 18% 100%, 0% 38%); }
        .shape-hexagon { clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 25%, 100% 75%, 50% 100%, 0% 75%, 0% 25%); }
        .shape-complex { clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 90% 20%, 100% 60%, 75% 100%, 25% 100%, 0% 60%, 10% 20%); }
        
        .cutline { border: 2px dashed #ec4899; position: absolute; top: 2px; bottom: 2px; left: 2px; right: 2px; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.8; z-index: 10; }
        .shape-circle .cutline, .shape-eclipse .cutline { border-radius: 50%; }
        .shape-triangle .cutline { clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 0% 100%, 100% 100%); border: none; background: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.2); }
        .shape-pentagon .cutline { clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 38%, 82% 100%, 18% 100%, 0% 38%); border: none; background: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.2); }
        .shape-hexagon .cutline { clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 25%, 100% 75%, 50% 100%, 0% 75%, 0% 25%); border: none; background: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.2); }
        .shape-complex .cutline { clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 90% 20%, 100% 60%, 75% 100%, 25% 100%, 0% 60%, 10% 20%); border: none; background: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.2); }

        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #f1f1f1; border-radius: 4px; }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 4px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800 antialiased">

    <header class="bg-dark text-white py-4 shadow-lg sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
					<span class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">HOÀNG<span class="text-emerald-400">MÂN</span></span>
					<span class="text-xs bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30">In Ấn Tem Nhãn 0977686717</span>
				</div>
            </div>
			<!-- ADMIN ONLY -->
			<!-- 
            <button onclick="toggleAdminModal()" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition bg-gray-800 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-gray-700">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-gear text-sm"></i> Bảng giá xưởng
            </button>
			-->
			<!-- ADMIN ONLY -->
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
        
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
            <!-- 1. Hình dạng & Kích thước -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-6">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 border-b pb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-shapes text-primary mr-2"></i>1. Hình dạng & Kích thước</h2>
                <div class="mb-5">
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-4 md:grid-cols-7 gap-2">
                        <label class="cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="shape" value="rectangle" class="peer hidden" checked onchange="updateUI()"><div class="border rounded-lg p-2 text-center peer-checked:border-primary peer-checked:bg-blue-50 hover:bg-gray-50"><i class="fa-regular fa-rectangle-wide text-lg mb-1"></i><br><span class="text-[10px] font-bold">Chữ nhật</span></div></label>
                        <label class="cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="shape" value="circle" class="peer hidden" onchange="updateUI()"><div class="border rounded-lg p-2 text-center peer-checked:border-primary peer-checked:bg-blue-50 hover:bg-gray-50"><i class="fa-regular fa-circle text-lg mb-1"></i><br><span class="text-[10px] font-bold">Tròn</span></div></label>
                        <label class="cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="shape" value="eclipse" class="peer hidden" onchange="updateUI()"><div class="border rounded-lg p-2 text-center peer-checked:border-primary peer-checked:bg-blue-50 hover:bg-gray-50"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-half-stroke text-lg mb-1"></i><br><span class="text-[10px] font-bold">Eclipse</span></div></label>
                        <label class="cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="shape" value="triangle" class="peer hidden" onchange="updateUI()"><div class="border rounded-lg p-2 text-center peer-checked:border-primary peer-checked:bg-blue-50 hover:bg-gray-50"><i class="fa-solid fa-play -rotate-90 text-lg mb-1"></i><br><span class="text-[10px] font-bold">Tam giác</span></div></label>
                        <label class="cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="shape" value="pentagon" class="peer hidden" onchange="updateUI()"><div class="border rounded-lg p-2 text-center peer-checked:border-primary peer-checked:bg-blue-50 hover:bg-gray-50"><i class="fa-regular fa-draw-polygon text-lg mb-1"></i><br><span class="text-[10px] font-bold">Ngũ giác</span></div></label>
                        <label class="cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="shape" value="hexagon" class="peer hidden" onchange="updateUI()"><div class="border rounded-lg p-2 text-center peer-checked:border-primary peer-checked:bg-blue-50 hover:bg-gray-50"><i class="fa-solid fa-cube text-lg mb-1"></i><br><span class="text-[10px] font-bold">Lục giác</span></div></label>
                        <label class="cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="shape" value="complex" class="peer hidden" onchange="updateUI()"><div class="border rounded-lg p-2 text-center peer-checked:border-primary peer-checked:bg-blue-50 hover:bg-gray-50"><i class="fa-solid fa-star text-lg mb-1 text-red-500"></i><br><span class="text-[10px] font-bold">Phức tạp</span></div></label>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1" id="label-width">Ngang (mm)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="width" value="50" min="10" class="w-full px-4 py-2 border rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary outline-none" oninput="calculate()">
                    </div>
                    <div id="height-container">
                        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1" id="label-height">Dọc (mm)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="height" value="50" min="10" class="w-full px-4 py-2 border rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary outline-none" oninput="calculate()">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. Chất liệu & Gia công -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-6">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 border-b pb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group text-primary mr-2"></i>2. Chất liệu & Gia công</h2>
                <div class="mb-5">
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
                        <label class="cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="material" value="nhua_sua" class="peer hidden" checked onchange="calculate()"><div class="border rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-center peer-checked:border-primary peer-checked:bg-blue-50 peer-checked:text-primary text-sm font-medium">Decal Nhựa Sữa</div></label>
                        <label class="cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="material" value="pp" class="peer hidden" onchange="calculate()"><div class="border rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-center peer-checked:border-primary peer-checked:bg-blue-50 peer-checked:text-primary text-sm font-medium">Decal PP</div></label>
                        <label class="cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="material" value="trong" class="peer hidden" onchange="calculate()"><div class="border rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-center peer-checked:border-primary peer-checked:bg-blue-50 peer-checked:text-primary text-sm font-medium">Decal Nhựa Trong</div></label>
                        <label class="cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="material" value="xi" class="peer hidden" onchange="calculate()"><div class="border rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-center peer-checked:border-primary peer-checked:bg-blue-50 peer-checked:text-primary text-sm font-medium">Decal Xi Bạc/Vàng</div></label>
                        <label class="cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="material" value="kraft" class="peer hidden" onchange="calculate()"><div class="border rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-center peer-checked:border-yellow-600 peer-checked:bg-yellow-50 peer-checked:text-yellow-700 text-sm font-medium">Decal Kraft Nâu</div></label>
                        <label class="cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="material" value="giay" class="peer hidden" onchange="calculate()"><div class="border rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-center peer-checked:border-primary peer-checked:bg-blue-50 peer-checked:text-primary text-sm font-medium">Decal Giấy</div></label>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium mb-1">Cán màng bảo vệ:</label>
                    <select id="coating" class="w-full px-4 py-2 border rounded-lg outline-none" onchange="calculate()">
                        <option value="none">Không cán màng</option>
                        <option value="bong">Cán màng (Bóng / Mờ)</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3. Thuế & Số lượng -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-6">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 border-b pb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-invoice-dollar text-primary mr-2"></i>Thuế (VAT)</h2>
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                            <label class="cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="tax" value="0" class="peer hidden" checked onchange="calculate()"><div class="border rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-center peer-checked:border-primary peer-checked:bg-blue-50 peer-checked:text-primary text-sm font-medium">Chưa thuế</div></label>
                            <label class="cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="tax" value="0.08" class="peer hidden" onchange="calculate()"><div class="border rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-center peer-checked:border-primary peer-checked:bg-blue-50 peer-checked:text-primary text-sm font-medium">8% VAT</div></label>
                            <label class="cursor-pointer"><input type="radio" name="tax" value="0.1" class="peer hidden" onchange="calculate()"><div class="border rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-center peer-checked:border-primary peer-checked:bg-blue-50 peer-checked:text-primary text-sm font-medium">10% VAT</div></label>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 border-b pb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-hashtag text-primary mr-2"></i>Số lượng in</h2>
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                            <input type="number" id="quantity" value="1000" min="10" step="10" class="w-full px-4 py-3 text-xl font-bold text-center border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary outline-none" oninput="calculate()">
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-1">
                                <button onclick="setQty(500)" class="py-2 bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 rounded text-xs font-bold text-gray-700">500</button>
                                <button onclick="setQty(1000)" class="py-2 bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 rounded text-xs font-bold text-gray-700">1K</button>
                                <button onclick="setQty(3000)" class="py-2 bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 rounded text-xs font-bold text-gray-700">3K</button>
                                <button onclick="setQty(5000)" class="py-2 bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 rounded text-xs font-bold text-gray-700">5K</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
            
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[300px] relative overflow-hidden bg-[url('https://transparenttextures.com/patterns/cubes.png')]">
                <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600 z-20 shadow-sm border border-gray-200">Mô phỏng</div>
                
                <div class="absolute top-3 right-3 z-20 flex flex-col gap-2 items-end">
                    <label class="flex items-center cursor-pointer text-xs font-semibold bg-white/90 backdrop-blur px-2 py-1.5 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200 hover:bg-blue-50 transition text-primary">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up mr-1.5"></i> Tải Logo
                        <input type="file" id="image-upload" accept="image/*" class="hidden" onchange="handleImageUpload(event)">
                    </label>
                    <label class="flex items-center cursor-pointer text-xs font-semibold bg-white/90 backdrop-blur px-2 py-1 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="show-cutline" class="mr-1" onchange="toggleCutline()" checked> Hiện dao bế
                    </label>
                </div>
                
                <div id="preview-wrapper" class="relative flex items-center justify-center p-4 transition-all duration-300 w-full h-[250px]">
                    <div id="preview-item" class="mat-nhua-sua shape-rectangle relative flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-500" style="width: 150px; height: 150px;">
                        <div id="preview-cutline" class="cutline"></div>
                        <div id="preview-icon-wrapper" class="text-center p-2 z-10 pointer-events-none">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-crown text-3xl mb-1 opacity-50" id="preview-icon"></i>
                        </div>
                        <img id="preview-user-img" src="" alt="Logo" class="hidden absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-0">
                    </div>
                    <div class="absolute bottom-2 text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium" id="preview-dim-w">50mm</div>
                    <div class="absolute right-2 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium rotate-90" id="preview-dim-h">50mm</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Box Thông số Kỹ thuật & Thuật toán ĐẦY ĐỦ YÊU CẦU 3 PHẦN -->
            <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm text-sm overflow-hidden">
                <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-800 bg-gray-50 p-4 border-b border-gray-200"><i class="fa-solid fa-list-check text-primary mr-2"></i>Thông số Kỹ thuật & Thuật toán</h4>
                <div class="p-4 bg-white max-h-[400px] overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar">
                    <table class="w-full text-[13px] text-gray-600">
                        <tbody>
                            <!-- Phần In -->
                            <tr><td colspan="2" class="font-bold text-gray-800 pb-1 pt-1 uppercase text-[11px] tracking-wider">Phần In</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="py-1">Khổ giấy in:</td><td class="py-1 text-right font-medium text-gray-800">33cm x 35cm</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="py-1">Loại giấy in:</td><td class="py-1 text-right font-medium text-gray-800" id="ui-info-mat">...</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="py-1">Tổng diện tích in:</td><td class="py-1 text-right font-medium text-gray-800" id="ui-info-total-area">... cm²</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="py-1 text-primary">Điều kiện áp dụng giá in:</td><td class="py-1 text-right font-medium text-primary" id="ui-info-method">...</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="py-1">Số tem xếp trên 1 tờ:</td><td class="py-1 text-right font-medium text-gray-800" id="ui-info-persheet">... tem</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="py-1">Số lượng tờ:</td><td class="py-1 text-right font-medium text-gray-800" id="ui-info-sheets">... tờ</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="py-1 font-semibold text-gray-800">Thành tiền phần in:</td><td class="py-1 text-right font-bold text-gray-800" id="ui-info-print-total">...</td></tr>
                            
                            <tr><td colspan="2"><hr class="my-1.5 border-gray-100"></td></tr>
                            
                            <!-- Phần Cán Màng -->
                            <tr><td colspan="2" class="font-bold text-blue-700 pb-1 pt-1 uppercase text-[11px] tracking-wider">Phần Cán Màng</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="py-1 text-blue-700">Diện tích cán màng:</td><td class="py-1 text-right font-medium text-blue-700" id="ui-info-coat-area">...</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="py-1 text-blue-700">Điều kiện áp dụng giá cán màng:</td><td class="py-1 text-right font-medium text-blue-700" id="ui-info-coat-cond">...</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="py-1 text-blue-700">Đơn giá áp dụng cán màng:</td><td class="py-1 text-right font-medium text-blue-700" id="ui-info-coat-unit">...</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="py-1 font-semibold text-blue-700">Thành tiền cán màng:</td><td class="py-1 text-right font-bold text-blue-700" id="ui-info-coat-total">...</td></tr>
                            
                            <tr><td colspan="2"><hr class="my-1.5 border-gray-100"></td></tr>
                            
                            <!-- Phần Bế -->
                            <tr><td colspan="2" class="font-bold text-pink-600 pb-1 pt-1 uppercase text-[11px] tracking-wider">Phần Bế (Cắt theo viền Tem)</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="py-1 text-pink-600">Diện tích in được bế:</td><td class="py-1 text-right font-medium text-pink-600" id="ui-info-cut-area">... cm²</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="py-1 text-pink-600">Đơn giá bế (<span id="ui-info-cut-shape" class="italic font-normal"></span>):</td><td class="py-1 text-right font-medium text-pink-600" id="ui-info-cut-unit">... đ/cm²</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="py-1 font-semibold text-pink-600">Thành tiền bế:</td><td class="py-1 text-right font-bold text-pink-600" id="ui-info-cut-total">...</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-dark rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-gray-700 p-6 text-white relative">
                <h3 class="text-lg text-gray-300 mb-1">Tổng tiền thanh toán</h3>
                <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-secondary mb-2 drop-shadow-md" id="final-price">0đ</div>
                
                <div class="space-y-2 border-t border-gray-700 pt-4 text-sm text-gray-300">
                    <div class="flex justify-between">
                        <span>Tạm tính (chưa thuế):</span>
                        <span id="sub-total" class="font-medium text-gray-400">0đ</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between text-yellow-400" id="tax-row">
                        <span>Tiền thuế:</span>
                        <span id="tax-amount" class="font-medium">0đ</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between border-t border-gray-600 pt-2 mt-2">
                        <span>Đơn giá / 1 con:</span>
                        <span id="unit-price" class="font-semibold text-white">0đ</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-6 flex gap-3">
                    <button onclick="showInvoiceModal()" class="flex-1 bg-secondary hover:bg-green-600 text-white font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded-lg transition text-center shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center text-lg">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-receipt mr-2"></i> Lập Phiếu & Chụp Ảnh
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Modal Admin -->
    <div id="admin-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/60 z-[100] hidden flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-sm p-4">
        <div class="bg-white w-full max-w-5xl rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-6 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto relative">
            <button onclick="toggleAdminModal()" class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-gray-400 hover:text-red-500 text-xl"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Cấu Hình Bảng Giá (Ma Trận Mới)</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">Các điều kiện tính giá phụ thuộc vào Diện Tích Tổng ($cm^2$) và Số Lượng Tem.</p>
            
            <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6">
                <h3 class="text-md font-bold mb-2 text-blue-700 bg-blue-50 p-2 rounded">A. Nhóm Giá tính theo TỜ (Dành cho Tổng diện tích < 8704 cm² VÀ Số lượng < 1000)</h3>
                <table class="w-full text-xs text-left mb-4 border border-gray-200">
                    <thead class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 uppercase font-bold">
                        <tr>
                            <th class="px-2 py-2">Chất liệu</th>
                            <th class="px-2 py-2">Mốc 1 (1 - 4351 cm²)<br>Giá / Tờ</th>
                            <th class="px-2 py-2">Mốc 2 (4352 - 8704 cm²)<br>Giá / Tờ</th>
                            <th class="px-2 py-2 bg-yellow-50 text-yellow-800">Cán màng (+ Giá/Tờ)</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody id="admin-sheet-pricing" class="divide-y divide-gray-200"></tbody>
                </table>

